{
  "about": "The refusals, and the admissions beside them, of a specification's row templates over its column defaults, prepared without a project or in a project whose function files each define the integer identity they name: a grouped filter over a window its template completes (ROW-1), a default every template replaces that is still checked, call cycles through inherited and overriding derivations (COLUMN-6), a forward reference through a call (COLUMN-5), defaults that are not row-local (SPEC-6) and row reads of what only the column phase completes (COLUMN-4). With `sources`, `prepare_in` prepares the document in the project and reports what binding it to those schemas refuses. Each case writes its specification whole: SRC, read from input.csv with the schema ID, int, gives the key column ID, which each row template derives from SRC.ID. A case whose table compared part of a record compares those fields, and an `among` case finds its record by cause among the others.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "grouped_filters_admit_completed_candidate_windows",
      "operation": "bind",
      "input": {
        "document": {
          "yamaa": "1.0",
          "type": "spec",
          "domain": "TEST",
          "input": {"SRC": {"path": "input.csv"}},
          "keys": ["ID"],
          "columns": [
            {"name": "ID", "type": "int", "derivation": {"value": "SRC.ID"}},
            {"name": "SEQ", "type": "int", "derivation": {"value": 0}}
          ],
          "output": {"path": "output.csv", "columns": ["ID", "SEQ"]},
          "rows": [
            {"id": "groups", "derivations": {"ID": {"value": "SRC.ID"}, "SEQ": {"value": {"row_number": {"window": {"order_by": ["ID"]}}}}}, "group_by": ["SRC.ID"], "filter": "SEQ > 1"}
          ]
        },
        "sources": {"SRC": [["ID", "int"]]}
      },
      "issues": []
    },
